## 10. Tool needed (not yet written)

`tools/session_vs_outside.py` must: run the frozen backtest once per symbol, tag each trade in/out of window by signal time, de-duplicate, fit the pooled clustered OLS, and print only the section 6 numbers. It must be reviewed before the freeze. A bug found after the freeze voids the holdout.
